1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,705
The Early Bird
早起的鸟儿

2
00:00:00,705 --> 00:00:02,145
Catches the Worm (Maybe)
抓住虫子（也许）

3
00:00:02,145 --> 00:00:02,982
Story by S v
S v的故事

4
00:00:02,982 --> 00:00:03,345
Richard
理查德

5
00:00:03,345 --> 00:00:04,413
Bud is a bird
巴德是一只鸟

6
00:00:04,413 --> 00:00:07,405
He wakes up early to catch a worm
他早起去抓虫子

7
00:00:07,573 --> 00:00:09,324
Bud is very hungry
Bud很饿

8
00:00:09,333 --> 00:00:10,445
Will is a worm
Will是条虫子

9
00:00:10,454 --> 00:00:12,365
He moves around in the dirt
他在泥土里走来走去

10
00:00:12,614 --> 00:00:14,644
Will sees Bud flying in the sky
威尔看到巴德在天上飞

11
00:00:15,173 --> 00:00:19,125
Bud is looking for food "I must hide," says Will
巴德正在寻找食物，“我必须藏起来，”威尔说

12
00:00:19,533 --> 00:00:20,885
Will moves to the grass
威尔走向草地

13
00:00:20,934 --> 00:00:24,612
He still sees Bud flying in the sky "I am not safe here
他还看到Bud在天上飞"我在这里不安全

14
00:00:24,614 --> 00:00:26,454
I must hide somewhere else "
我必须藏在别的地方”

15
00:00:26,454 --> 00:00:28,125
Will moves near a tree
会在一棵树附近移动

16
00:00:28,213 --> 00:00:29,565
He hides in the shade
他躲在阴凉处

17
00:00:29,893 --> 00:00:33,045
Bud flies around the tree "The shade does not hide me!"
芽绕着树飞“树荫藏不住我！”

18
00:00:33,173 --> 00:00:34,645
Will moves to the garden
威尔搬到花园

19
00:00:34,893 --> 00:00:39,965
He still sees Bud flying in the sky "I must find some place safe to hide " Will says
他仍然看到巴德在天上飞“我必须找个安全的地方藏起来”威尔说

20
00:00:40,334 --> 00:00:43,484
Will looks around and disappears as Bud swoops down
威尔环顾四周，巴德俯冲下来时，他消失了

21
00:00:44,213 --> 00:00:46,804
Bud eats some bird seeds that he finds on the ground
巴德吃了一些他在地上找到的鸟的种子

22
00:00:47,213 --> 00:00:48,292
Bud did not see Will
Bud没看到Will

23
00:00:48,293 --> 00:00:53,204
Bud flies away as Will pokes his head out of an apple that fell from the tree!
巴德飞走了，威尔从树上掉下来的苹果里探出头来！

24
00:00:53,374 --> 00:00:56,725
Will smiles and says "That was close!"
威尔微笑着说：“差一点！”

